    <string name="privacy_title">Your data stays on your device</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">ChangeLens stores projects, photos, and settings only on this device — in a local SQLite database and private app files. There are no accounts and no cloud uploads. Photos you add are copied into private app storage so they are never overwritten. You choose exactly when to share exports with other apps.</string>

